Cairn v0.0.17

• Easier setup: restore a device, or just get started.
• Choose your home: Classic, People first or Map first.
• Dark mode, and a side-by-side map in landscape.
• New Settings screen.
• Shares while the app is open, not just on the map.
• Background sharing never runs when it's switched off or its notification is hidden.
• Live "last seen" times without refreshing.
• Clearer code scanning, with an easy paste option.
• Update prompts when a new version is out.

All end-to-end encrypted.
